ly</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Working towards a simple case definition for influenza surveillance.</article-title><source>Journal of Clinical Virology</source><volume>27</volume><fpage>170</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12829039</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005079-Druce1"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Druce</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Tran</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaye</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chibo</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Laboratory diagnosis and surveillance of human respiratory viruses by PCR in Victoria, Australia, 2002&#x02013;2003.</article-title><source>Journal of Medical Virology</source><volume>75</volume><fpage>122</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15543580</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005079-Watts1"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Watts</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Andrews</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Druce</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Establishing thresholds for influenza surveillance in Victoria.</article-title><source>Australian and New Zealand Journal of Public Health</source><volume>27</volume><fpage>409</fpage><lpage>412</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14705303</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005079-StataCorp1"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>StataCorp</collab><year>2008</year><source>Statistical Software: Release 10.0</so